🚀 Calling Stored Procedures from Excel with Power Query 🔄📊

Just wrapped up a neat integration project where I connected the power of SQL Server stored procedures with the flexibility of Excel + Power Query. 🎯

📌 What does it do?

Users enter parameters in Excel (e.g. grouping and metric options)

Power Query dynamically calls a stored procedure with those inputs

The result? Automatically refreshed, aggregated data straight into Excel — no manual queries or copy-paste

💡 This solution is:

 ✅ Flexible

 ✅ Scalable

 ✅ Ideal for teams that live in Excel but want SQL performance behind the scenes
